2026-07-28T07:03:05.8141175Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-28T07:03:05.8141564Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-28T07:03:05.8142174Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-28T07:03:05.8143101Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-28T07:03:05.8143802Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
